	file.0000000000000001.title: "&fOur Story: Earth 1.21"
	quest.00000000000002D6.quest_desc: ["Killing animals is cruelty. Delicious, jucy cruelty. "]
	quest.00000000000002D6.title: "Food For Days"
	quest.00000000000002E0.quest_desc: ["The nether is full of dangerous monsters. Destroy them before they destroy you. "]
	quest.00000000000002E0.title: "Nether Dangers"
	quest.00000000000002E8.quest_desc: ["Night time is dark and scary. Monsters come out at night. Brandish your sword and take aim and destroy your nemeses."]
	quest.00000000000002E8.title: "Deadly"
	quest.00000000000002F6.quest_desc: ["Travel to the end and slay the end dragon. "]
	quest.00000000000002F6.title: "Here Be Dragons"
	quest.00000000000002FB.quest_desc: ["Place an end crystal on the center block of each side of the end fountain and it will respawn the end dragon. Slay it again to get another egg. "]
	quest.00000000000002FB.title: "Rebirth"
	quest.0DEBC61F8E0B71C2.quest_desc: [
		"To share your quests with your friends, you need to create a team."
		""
		"To do this, type the command: \"/ftbteams party create\" or use the menu at top left."
		""
		"From here, you can click on Settings to configure your team (name, color, description, etc.)."
		""
		"Now you can add your friends from the same interface and start your shared adventure together."
	]
	quest.0DEBC61F8E0B71C2.quest_subtitle: "Read my description!"
	quest.0DEBC61F8E0B71C2.title: "&eFTB Teams"
	quest.2AA9784F0526D00D.quest_desc: ["The wither is a ferocious enemy. Summon him and defeat him to gain the powerfull nether star core that animates the skulls and sand."]
	quest.2AA9784F0526D00D.title: "Withering Heights"
	quest.2B04C39F8061A391.quest_desc: [
		"Welcome to Our Story."
		""
		"Do you like exploring and discovering new lands? You also like to make automated machines to have unlimited resources? You'll find something for you in this modpack."
		""
		"Thanks to the future quests that will be set up, you will be able to write your story through exploration, technology, magic and many other mods."
		""
		"We wish you a good game!"
	]
	quest.2B04C39F8061A391.title: "Welcome"
	quest.3269DBDB2904B394.quest_desc: [
		"Using the quest book is quite simple. The Left side of the screen is known as tabs. Each tab has quest trees which you can see in each tab. "
		"Clicking and dragging outside of a quest will move the page around. Clicking on a quest will open it. The quest tasks are on the left side and are automatically detected from your inventry or your interactions with the world. "
		"The rewards for completing quests are on the right and will unlock once all tasks of the quest are completed. "
		"The left arrow at the top of a quest will tell you what quests are required for the quest to unlock. The right arrow will tell you what completing that quest will unlock. "
		"You can scroll in or out on the interface using the scroll wheel. "
		"Finally the quests lines and individual quests are hidden until you have unlocked the quest before it. They will unlock and open up as you progress through the pack. "
	]
	quest.366705735F06E60E.quest_desc: [
		"At the bottom of the inventory, you may have noticed a search bar."
		""
		"This is the &dJust Enough Items&r, or &dJEI&r, search bar. "
		""
		"If you type \"Wood\", for example, the &dJEI &ritem list at the right of the screen will show all items with \"Wood\" in the name."
		""
		"Adding a @ at the start of the search query will show the items from a specific mod, for example @Chipped"
		""
	]
	quest.366705735F06E60E.quest_subtitle: "Read my description!"
	quest.3D5841B8216C4182.quest_desc: [
		"To share your quests with your friends, you need to create a team."
		""
		"To do this, type the command:"
		"/ftbteams party create."
		""
		"Now go to your inventory menu and click on the button at the top left \"My Team\"."
		"You can, from there, click on Settings to configure your team (name, color, description, etc ...)"
		""
		"You just have to invite your friends with the command:"
		"/ftbteams party invite NAME"
		""
		"Your friends just have to accept, and you are now in a team."
		""
		"If you want to join an already existing team you just have to type the command:"
		"/ftbteams party join TEAM NAME"
	]
	quest.4120AB56E16B718C.quest_desc: [
		"The icon in the top left of the screen is the &aFTB Teams &rmenu. This allows you to add other players to your team."
		""
		"On the right of the &aFTB Teams &ricon is the &6Quest Book &ricon, which allows you to access the &6Quest Book &rat any time."
		""
		"Quests are there to stimulate your adventure and guide you through the modpack, earning you rewards along the way."
	]
	quest.4120AB56E16B718C.quest_subtitle: "Read my description!"
	quest.4120AB56E16B718C.title: "&aInventory"
	quest.69124AEEB537FDBD.quest_desc: [
		"The tutorial is now &afinished&r! "
		""
		"New quests will appear in the menu on the left, sorted by category. Some will only appear in secret *shh*."
		""
		"Feel free to join our &bDiscord &rfor any other questions you may have: https://discord.gg/kb8NSTF45n"
	]
	quest.69124AEEB537FDBD.quest_subtitle: "Read my description!"
	quest.70476C63C90B6D05.quest_desc: [
		"This tutorial will walk you through some basic features. Rest assured, it won't take too long!"
		""
		"To begin, click the checkmark below the word \"Tasks,\" and then claim your quest reward. New quests will start to appear!"
		""
		"If new quests don't appear, try relaunching your world. Don't get rid of the mushrooms until the tutorial is finished."
		"{@pagebreak}"
	]
	quest.70476C63C90B6D05.quest_subtitle: "To start the tutorial, click on this quest and read the description."
	quest.7749B63BFF6F3CDF.quest_desc: ["Phantoms show up when you haven't slept in a few days. They can be a nusence. Kill them before they kill you. "]
	quest.7749B63BFF6F3CDF.title: "Night Terrors"
	quest.7FE28D790C05A013.quest_desc: [
		"Like I said, this modpack doesn't force you to play around with the quests."
		""
		"It's your choice to follow them or not."
		""
		"Be aware, however, that some quests give you explanations, for example how to enter the Twilight Forest."
	]
